<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <title>Noah Humbert</title>
        {% include 'partials/_head.html.twig' %}
    </head>
    <body>
        <!-- Top Navitation Bar-->
        {% include 'partials/_navbar.html.twig' %}

        <!-- Top Banner -->
        <div class="container mt-2 mb-5 text-center">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-12">
                    <p class="fs-1 my-0">Noah Humbert</p>
                    <p class="fs-4 my-0">I design simple, reliable systems that solve real world business problems</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="row mt-3 justify-content-center">
                <div class="col-lg-2 col-6 d-grid gap-2">
                    <a class="btn btn-primary" href=" {{ path('business-card') }} ">Contact Me</a>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-2 col-6 d-grid gap-2">
                    <a class="btn btn-secondary" href=" {{ path('business-card') }} ">OTHER button</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- About Me -->
        <div class="container my-5">

        </div>

        <!-- What I do Portion -->
        <div class="container my-5">
            <div class="row">
                <p class="fs-1 text-center">What I do</p>
            </div>
            <div class="row justify-content-center">
                <div class="card-group col-10 ">
                    <div class="card"> 
                        <h4 class="card-header text-center">
                            Workflow Automation & Internal Tools
                        </h4>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <p class="card-text">
                                - Get Rid of Messy Excel Sheets<br>
                                - Data Entry Automation<br>
                                - Auto-generated Reports<br>
                                - Batch file processing<br>
                                - Data Congregations
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card">
                        <h4 class="card-header text-center">
                            System Integration & Congregation
                        </h4>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <p class="card-text">
                                - Connect Invoicing into CRMs<br>
                                - Sync Databases<br>
                                - Migrate Data between Sources<br>
                                - Bridge Legacy Systems with Modern APIs
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card">
                        <h4 class="card-header text-center">
                            Custom Web Applications & Websites
                        </h4>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <p class="card-text">
                                - Internal Job Tracker<br>
                                - Inventory/Asset Management<br>
                                - Customer Portals<br>
                                - Booking/Scheduling Systems<br>
                                - Simple Dashboards<br>
                                - CRMs
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Portfolio Portion -->


        <!-- How we work -->
        <div class="container my-5">
            <div class="row justify-content-center">
                <div class="col-10 text-center">
                    <p class="fs-1 text-center">My Process</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="row justify-content-center">
                <div class="col-10">
                    <div class="accordion" id="processAccordian">
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#sectionOne" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="sectionOne">
                                    Discovery
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="sectionOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#processAccordian">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <strong>What is your issue?</strong> A free 1-on-1 meeting to discuss the business
                                    issue you are facing. What is the current process like? What are your biggest pain points
                                    with the current process? These are all questions that will be discussed along with any
                                    questions you have for me. 
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#sectionTwo" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="sectionTwo">
                                    Planning & Mock-Up
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="sectionTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#processAccordian">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <strong>What do you think about this?</strong> This portion will come after my initial
                                    brainstorming and research into the issue. I will come back with what my plan is to
                                    fix this issue along with an initial quote and timeframe at which the project will be
                                    completed in. If you have any business questions for me, this is your time to really
                                    drill me and ask. To move onto the "Demo Showcase" phase, a 10% deposit will be needed.
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#sectionThree" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="sectionThree">
                                    Demo Showcase
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="sectionThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#processAccordian">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <strong>Here it is...</strong> I wil showcase you my demo in a sample environment that 
                                    performs all of the tasks necessary to replace your business process. I have an enterprise 
                                    environment that I can utilize to spin up test servers in order to show off these demos. 
                                    We will use this time to discuss likes and dislikes along with any other functionality 
                                    that is needed. This is your chance to really get the fine details right. At this point, a
                                    final contract will be signed for the rest of the 90% of the agreed upon pricing.
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#sectionFour" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="sectionFour">
                                    Full Development & Deployment
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="sectionFour" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#processAccordian">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <strong>Let's get it right...</strong> Multiple follow up meetings are expected during
                                    this phase. This is getting all of your data integrated into the new process and deploying
                                    it into your enterprise environment. With my experience both in the cloud and on premise,
                                    I will be able to deploy your app exceptionally. One of my pet peeves is not getting
                                    something done right the first time, and your business will be no exception to that.
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#sectionFive" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="sectionFive">
                                    Post-Deployment
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="sectionFive" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#processAccordian">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <strong>What Now?</strong> The new process has been implemented. Your employees are thriving
                                    with it and have drastically increased their productivity. What do you do to keep this
                                    production up? I will provide sufficient contact information to keep in touch if you
                                    so desire. There is also the option for me to pass along my knowledge to your current IT
                                    team. No matter what you choose, if everything absolutely hits the floor, I will always
                                    be happy to help in emergency.
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Closing CTA -->
        <div class="container my-5">
            <div class="row">
                <p class="fs-1 text-center">Contact Me</p>
            </div>
            <div class="row justify-content-center">
                <div class="col-12 text-center">
                    {% include 'partials/_business-card.html.twig' %}
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Javascript -->
        <script src="{{ asset('bootstrap/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js') }}"></script>
    </body>
</html>